{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Mathmate3》是一款專為小學 3 至 4 年級學生設計的數位練習簿 App，適合希望減少孩子螢幕時間同時提升數學能力的家長。這款應用程式涵蓋超過 10 個核心主題與 100 多個單元，能替代繁重的紙本練習冊。目前軟體正推出原價 US $0.99 的限時免費優惠，無廣告且無需網絡連線即可使用。</p>\n\n<h2>無限練習與智能學習推薦</h2>\n<p>App 提供無限量的題目與即時自動對答案功能，為家長節省大量批改時間。內建智能推薦系統可根據學習情況引導練習，著重加強弱項。簡潔的無打擾介面搭配詳細進度報告，既能保護兒童私隱與專注力，亦讓家長輕鬆掌握學習成果。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-88-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-89-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-90-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-92-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-93-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Mathmate3</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T08:19:12.827160+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}